<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>SCP XXXX is a female Balaeniceps Rex with average health and weight for members of its species.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Not <em>quite</em> sure I like how this sounds, perhaps something like &quot;SCP-XXXX is a female Balaeniceps Rex typical of its species&quot; or something along that nature?<br />
(Also, don't forget the dash between SCP and XXXX ^^)</p>
